+# S5-CLM-00003491 theorem package
+
+This package closes the frozen Formal Conjectures theorem
+`Arxiv.«1609.08688».maximalLength_ge_of_isSquare`: when `n` is a perfect
+square, the maximum length of a 2-increasing list of triples over `[1,n]` is at
+least `n.sqrt^3`.
+
+The local Lean proof constructs, for `n=m²`, the `m³` triples
+
+```text
+(i*m+j+1, i*m+k+1, j*m+k+1),  0 ≤ i,j,k < m,
+```
+
+in lexicographic `(i,j,k)` order.  At the first differing digit, two
+coordinates increase.  The proof also establishes the boundedness required to
+use the source definition's natural-number supremum.
+
+## Package map
+
+- `intake.json`: frozen identity, source, rights, and Stage6 binding
+- `Statement.lean` and `statement-crosswalk.json`: exact statement and both transports
+- `anchor-audit.json`: content-addressed human/source/machine anchors
+- `proof-units.json`: complete typed DAG
+- `Proof.lean` and `machine-closure.json`: M0-L closure and declaration census
+- `machine-checked-audit.md`: trust boundary and axiom probe
+- `proof-outline.md` and `full-study.md`: readable reconstruction
+- `readability-review.json`: injective node/fragment ledger and reverse coverage
+- `Audit.lean`: exact-type and kernel-axiom probes
+- `build-validation.md` and `receipts/current-validation.json`: cold replay evidence
+- `meta.json`: package-level completion and artifact manifest
+- `receipts/release-decision.json`: provisional worker release decision
+
+The package is self-tested but not self-accepted.  Canonical integration,
+independent replay, and checklist transition remain exclusively the Master’s
+responsibility.
